    "created_at": "2020-04-05T03:20:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-04-05T03:20:11Z",
    "body": "The major value is for mobile user agents, which (assuming the `inputmode` attribute is absent) bring up a different keyboard depending on the `type` of an input field. This is illustrated in the [MDN web docs](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/input/tel#Custom_keyboards).\r\n\r\nEven if a user is entering only part of a telephone number, the telephone-number keyboard would be appropriate.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
