    "created_at": "2020-04-11T06:56:58Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-04-11T06:57:24Z",
    "body": "Right, [`inputmode=\"tel\"`](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Global_attributes/inputmode) is the correct way to get a keyboard for telephone numbers when `type=\"tel\"` isn't appropriate (e.g. because it's a partial telephone number).",
